  <title>Final Exam Time</title>

  <p>
    The final exam is scheduled for <alert>Wednesday, December 11 at 1:00 pm</alert>. We will use this time to finish final presentations. If you are not present for during the scheduled presentations, your grade on your presentation will be reduced by 3 percentage points for each presentation you miss. You may be excused for school sanctioned events, but you need to have your absence approved by me PRIOR to the presentation day. 
  </p>

